    </p>

    <h3>What is a keratin treatment?</h3>
    <p>
        A keratin treatment helps improve hair smoothness, reduce frizz, and give hair
        a healthier and shinier appearance.
    </p>

    <h3>Can I get hair coloring or balayage?</h3>
    <p>
        Yes, the salon provides coloring services, including balayage styles designed
        to match your desired look.
    </p>
